{"type":"text","timestamp":1794325066746,"sessionID":"ses_e39e70e5effeCYI8DTCFFfI5ZZ","part":{"id":"prt_1c61bb3e9001T81yVgxRcvP5p2","messageID":"msg_1c61ba5e4001tbnyqoO9jpk8uv","sessionID":"ses_e39e70e5effeCYI8DTCFFfI5ZZ","type":"text","text":"<think>Now, the frontend. Let me set up the project.\n\nFirst update package.json with dependencies:\n- react, react-dom (existing)\n- react-router-dom ^7\ndevDeps:\n- @types/react, @types/react-dom\n- @vitejs/plugin-react (existing)\n- tailwindcss, @tailwindcss/vite\n- typescript\n- vite (existing)\n\nThen npm install to update package-lock.json.\n\nLet me check whether npm install works offline/online. The npm registry is reachable (npm view worked).\n\nLet me update package.json and run npm install.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794325066729,"end":1794325066743}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794325066778,"sessionID":"ses_e39e70e5effeCYI8DTCFFfI5ZZ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_SSBXB2evbUzAVcuK3Pr6FqHc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\n  \"name\": \"app-frontend\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n    \"preview\": \"vite preview\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \"19.3.1\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"19.3.1\",\n    \"react-router-dom\": \"7.18.5\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@tailwindcss/vite\": \"4.3.5\",\n    \"@types/react\": \"19.3.0\",\n    \"@types/react-dom\": \"19.3.0\",\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-react\": \"6.2.1\",\n    \"tailwindcss\": \"4.3.5\",\n    \"typescript\": \"5.9.3\",\n    \"vite\": \"8.3.5\"\n  }\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/package.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/package.json","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/package.json","time":{"start":1794325066739,"end":1794325066758}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c61bb3ec0018MXpG9mIlYOVle","sessionID":"ses_e39e70e5effeCYI8DTCFFfI5ZZ","messageID":"msg_1c61ba5e4001tbnyqoO9jpk8uv"}}
