{"type":"text","timestamp":1794325330396,"sessionID":"ses_e39e70e5effeCYI8DTCFFfI5ZZ","part":{"id":"prt_1c61fb9be001WeW69e4tmwMdIY","messageID":"msg_1c61faa9d001pR5VR7EEaxZlcC","sessionID":"ses_e39e70e5effeCYI8DTCFFfI5ZZ","type":"text","text":"<think>Now let me test:\n1. Persistence across restart (stop gunicorn, restart, check data).\n2. The SPA fallback for deep links (already ✓).\n3. Static asset serving (CSS/JS) — verify the built asset URLs are served correctly.\n\nLet me check that the assets referenced by index.html are served.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794325330366,"end":1794325330392}}}
