{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794325365431,"sessionID":"ses_e39e70e5effeCYI8DTCFFfI5ZZ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_GV4BeyubgksCBfLQc4TQoxrJ","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/frontend && npx vite build --ssr src/ssr-check.tsx --outDir .tmp-ssr --logLevel warn 2>&1 | tail -5 && node .tmp-ssr/ssr-check.js && for f in public auth subscriptions detail; do echo \"=== $f ===\"; python3 -c \"\nimport re,sys\nhtml=open('.tmp-ssr/$f.html').read()\ntext=re.sub(r'<[^>]+>',' ',html)\ntext=re.sub(r'\\s+',' ',text)\nprint(text[:600])\n\"; done","timeout":180000},"output":"public: 4028 chars\nauth: 2971 chars\nsubscriptions: 4610 chars\ndetail: 1201 chars\n=== public ===\n B Billing Console Public summary Sign in Public summary Monthly recurring revenue — The sum of the monthly amounts of all active and past-due subscriptions. Trial and cancelled subscriptions are not counted. Subscriptions per status 0 total Active — Active subscriptions Trial — Trial subscriptions Past due — Past due subscriptions Cancelled — Cancelled subscriptions Team access Customer details, invoices and payment runs are private. Sign in with a team account to manage subscriptions. Sign in to the console Subscription billing console — signed-in team members can manage every subscription. \n=== auth ===\n B Billing Console Public summary Sign in Sign in Use your team account to manage subscriptions. Sign in Register Username Password Sign in Just looking for the numbers? View the public summary Subscription billing console — signed-in team members can manage every subscription. \n=== subscriptions ===\n B Billing Console Public summary Sign in Subscriptions Loading… New subscription All Active Trial Past due Cancelled All plans 10 / page 25 / page 50 / page Customer Plan MRR Renews Status Failed Created — Previous Next Subscription billing console — signed-in team members can manage every subscription. \n=== detail ===\n B Billing Console Public summary 