{"type":"text","timestamp":1794325399656,"sessionID":"ses_e39e70e5effeCYI8DTCFFfI5ZZ","part":{"id":"prt_1c620c853001SOF5Q222U3D46Y","messageID":"msg_1c620ba98001X0NR3XfY7JljIz","sessionID":"ses_e39e70e5effeCYI8DTCFFfI5ZZ","type":"text","text":"<think>Let me remove .tmp-pip and backend/__pycache__, and add a .gitignore for node_modules, dist, data, __pycache__.\n\nNote: frontend/dist is untracked — should it be committed? The Dockerfile builds the frontend inside the image, so dist doesn't need to be in git. I'll add it to .gitignore.\n\nLet me create a .gitignore.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794325399635,"end":1794325399653}}}
